If you love baseball, or sports managing sims in general, then OOTP 17 is a MUST buy. It's a fantastic game and a great time waster. I have spent mutiple nights staying up, trying to finalize that perfect trade that will push me to the post season.
Be aware that there is A LOT on the screen and A LOT of things to customize. It can be very overwhelming when you first start. But if you put in the time to learn, OOTP is one of the most satisfying games out there.
Also this game is the only way the Mariners can make the Post-Season ;-;
